# 暂停着存盘（第二阶段 1f84541：前端的存盘请求交给游戏线程去做）：暂停菜单开着时请存盘，要真的提交（冻结世界、临时放开暂停），
# 之后暂停照旧、关掉菜单游戏照常，全程无红标
# Saving while paused (phase 2, 1f84541: front-end save requests are carried out on the game thread): with the pause menu open, a save request must really commit (world frozen, pause released for the save),
# then the pause is restored, the menu closes and the game carries on, with no red markers throughout
name save_while_paused
save warlock
timeout 180

enter_game
open_pause
save_now timeout=5
expect save result=commit timeout=1
close_pause
stick 1 0 frames=20
expect_state in_game=true dead=false
quit
check saved
check no_red
check no_red_log
